    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-172/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.623243
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "A madman entered the bazaar and declaimed: The moon is more useful than the sun.",
      "path": "audio/1971-172/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9488659999999998,
      "end": 7.534717
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "But why? asked someone.",
      "path": "audio/1971-172/03.mp3",
      "start": 9.01059,
      "end": 11.232812
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "We need the light more during the night than during the day, he said.",
      "path": "audio/1971-172/04.mp3",
      "start": 12.618095,
      "end": 16.455397
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "And I say to you that all our metaphysical theories and explanations are not of more worth than the explanation of that madman.",
      "path": "audio/1971-172/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.824263,
      "end": 26.15
    }
  ]
}
